   "text": "City St George's University of London - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nCity St George's University of London\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nBuild your future by studying in the UK, with a pathway course at Kaplan International College (KIC) London. Situated in the world’s top academic city (QS Best Student Cities 2019), the College will prepare you for a university degree, and for a successful career. If you’ve finished high school but don’t meet the entry requirements for university, a Foundation Certificate can help you gain entry to an undergraduate degree. For progression to the 1st year of a bachelor’s degree at City, University of London. City has all the benefits students expect of a London university - strong links with business for career opportunities and unbeatable opportunities for sport, culture and entertainment, and is ranked 3rd&nbsp;in London for student satisfaction (Complete University Guide 2020). \nTimestamps\nUpdated\n08/06/2026 10:33\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n22/04/2026 05:25\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £34,589.70\nMin: £22,324.95\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n0%\n0 of 0 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nKaplan\nFounded Year\n1894\nCampus(es)\nLondon\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nBelarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Russia, Syria, Ukraine, United States, Pakistan\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n30/09/2025\nContract End Date\n01/01/2070\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TQhGwUmF9bU\nInternship Details\n-\nAddition